## Issue 3.10 - Implement Session Persistence and Schema Migration

Persist non-document state separately:

```text
windows.json
session layout
active tabs
recent metadata
```

Never treat this state as authoritative document content.

All persisted structures require:

```text
schemaVersion
migration path
