'unsafe-eval'
```

unless a dependency forces a temporary reviewed exception.

Deny renderer navigation to arbitrary URLs.

Remote `http://` resources are blocked by default.

Remote `https://` images follow explicit user policy.

No Markdown document may cause arbitrary network requests through hidden DOM tricks.

**Acceptance criteria**

A malicious Markdown fixture cannot navigate MarkHere to a remote page or automatically fetch blocked HTTP content.

