## Issue 9.7 - Apply and Verify Electron Fuses and ASAR Hardening

After compatibility testing, set production fuse policy.

Candidates from the architecture:

```text
RunAsNode = disabled
NodeOptions = disabled
NodeCliInspect = disabled
OnlyLoadAppFromAsar = enabled if compatible
EmbeddedAsarIntegrityValidation = enabled if compatible
GrantFileProtocolExtraPrivileges = disabled
```

Electron fuses are package-time feature switches intended specifically to disable unused powerful behavior. ([Electron][9])

Run a verification script against every packaged binary.

**Acceptance criteria**

CI stores fuse inspection results as release evidence.

**Traceability:** ADR-030, NFR-SEC-008.

